0 -14 Td
(• **Climate-Resilient Building Materials** \(Sub\): Heat- and flood-resistant materials developed for the US and Chinese retrofit markets are finding a manufacturing base in India's apparel_and_fashion sector.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(• **Green Hydrogen for Industrial Heat** \(Sub\): Electrolysis-based hydrogen is being piloted to replace natural gas in high-heat industrial processes, with India's low-cost renewable power giving apparel_and_fashion players a structural cost edge.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(• **Revenue-Based Financing** \(Sub\): Revenue-based financing structures popularized in the US are reaching India's apparel_and_fashion scale-ups as an alternative to priced equity rounds.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(• **Digital Sovereignty & Data Localization** \(Macro\): Nations are asserting control over data, compute, and critical digital infrastructure, driving regional platform build-outs and compliance requirements that shape how apparel_and_fashion companies architect for the US, China, and India.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(• **Quality & Traceability Tooling for Exporters** \(Sub\): Software that gives US and China buyers real-time quality and provenance data is becoming a prerequisite for India-based apparel_and_fashion exporters to win contracts.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(• **Capital Cost Normalization** \(Macro\): A structurally higher interest-rate regime versus the 2010s is repricing growth capital in the US and China, rewarding capital-efficient, cash-generative apparel_and_fashion business models over growth-at-all-costs.) Tj
